# Stale Swift compilation module caches: compiler outputs (.pcm/.swiftmodule/
# .timestamp). Product code and contract tests exclude this prefix by name and
# nothing consumes it as input; a rebuild regenerates it.
/.tmp-swift-module-cache-*/
# Local environment files. Example files (.env.example/.env.template) stay
# trackable - only the real secret-bearing names are guarded.
/.env
/.env.local
/.env.*.local

# Knowledge-project initialization artifacts that a workspace init can drop at
# a repo root; the shipped repo does not consume them (verified 2026-09-16).
/purpose.md
/schema.md
